<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
  <title>Action Required - KYC Verification Failed</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #f6f6f6;
      font-family: sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    h3 {
      color: #000000;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    p, ul {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    a.button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #ffffff;
      background-color: #ff4d4d;
      border-radius: 5px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #999999;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <h3>Dear {{syndicate_lead_name}},</h3>
      <p>Unfortunately, your KYC verification could not be completed due to <strong>{{failure_reason}}</strong>.</p>
      <p>To proceed, please log in to your Algoralign account and restart the KYC process with the correct documents.</p>
      <h4>What to Do Next:</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>🔹 Review the reason for failure in your dashboard.</li>
        <li>🔹 Re-upload the required documents.</li>
        <li>🔹 Submit again for review.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a href="{{retry_kyc_link}}" class="button">Retry KYC Verification</a></p>
      <p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact our support team at <a href="mailto:support@algoralign.com">support@algoralign.com</a>.</p>
      <p>Best regards,<br>The Algoralign Team</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>Powered by Algoralign</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
